course: dictionary
lesson: 14126
title: Everyday words in context
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Many words you use every day have a clear meaning, and context helps you check it. «Maya ordered a chocolate milkshake at the diner.» A diner is a place where you buy food and drink, so a milkshake must be something you can drink.
explain: «The milkshake was thick and cold, with ice cream blended into the milk.» The words cold, thick and blended are clues. A milkshake is a cold, sweet drink made by mixing milk with ice cream and a flavour.
explain: Check your meaning by putting it into the sentence. If you think a milkshake is a hot soup, then «Maya sipped her hot soup» does not fit with «thick and cold», so your guess is wrong.
fact: A milkshake is a cold, sweet drink.
fact: A milkshake is made by mixing milk with ice cream and a flavour such as chocolate, strawberry or banana.
fact: «Milkshake» is a noun: you can say a milkshake or some milkshakes.
fact: Milkshakes have a lot of sugar and fat, so they are a «sometimes» food.
fact: The froth on top of a milkshake is trapped air.
exercise: «Maya ordered a chocolate milkshake at the diner.» What is a milkshake? | A sour sauce for chips | A hot soup with vegetables | *A cold, sweet drink made with milk and ice cream | A kind of bread roll
exercise: «The milkshake was thick and cold, with ice cream blended into the milk.» Copy one word from the sentence that tells you the milkshake is cold. | blended | with | thick | *cold
exercise: Why is a milkshake called a «sometimes» food? | Because it is made of vegetables | Because it has no milk in it | *Because it has a lot of sugar and fat | Because it is always served hot
test: «Jay asked for a banana milkshake.» What flavour did Jay choose? | Chocolate | *Banana | Lemon | Strawberry
test: What is the froth on top of a milkshake? | Spilt sugar | Sour cream | Melted chocolate | *Trapped air
exam: «After a long hot walk, Sam chose a cold strawberry milkshake.» Why would Sam choose a milkshake? | *It is cold and sweet, so it cools him down | It is a kind of bread | It is made of cheese | It is hot and spicy, so it warms him up
